    verir (LED parlakl\u0131\u011F\u0131, motor h\u0131z\u0131). SDA/SCL ise I2C
    haberle\u015Fme hatt\u0131d\u0131r."
  funFact: "Mega'da 15 PWM pini vard\u0131r; analogWrite() yaln\u0131zca bu pinlerde
    \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131r."
